    "A link asks Poki to connect through %@. Whoever runs that relay can see your screen and act on this iPhone through Poki. Allow it only if you set up this relay yourself." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A link asks Poki to connect through %@. Whoever runs that relay can see your screen and act on this iPhone through Poki. Allow it only if you set up this relay yourself."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有链接要求 Poki 通过 %@ 连接。运行该中转的人可以通过 Poki 查看你的屏幕并操作此 iPhone。仅在这是你本人搭建的中转时才允许。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有連結要求 Poki 透過 %@ 連線。執行該中轉的人可以透過 Poki 查看你的螢幕並操作此 iPhone。僅在這是你本人架設的中轉時才允許。"
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Một liên kết yêu cầu Poki kết nối qua %@. Người vận hành dịch vụ chuyển tiếp đó có thể xem màn hình và thao tác trên iPhone này qua Poki. Chỉ cho phép nếu bạn tự thiết lập dịch vụ chuyển tiếp này."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A link carries a pairing file for Poki. It replaces the pairing this iPhone has now, and automation stops if the file is wrong. Allow it only if you made it yourself in Poki Setup." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A link carries a pairing file for Poki. It replaces the pairing this iPhone has now, and automation stops if the file is wrong. Allow it only if you made it yourself in Poki Setup."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有链接为 Poki 带来了配对文件。它会替换此 iPhone 现有的配对，文件有误时自动化将停止工作。仅在这是你本人用 Poki Setup 生成的文件时才允许。"
          }
