    "Turn on the loopback in your proxy app: the Poki module in Surge or Loon, loopback_address in sing-box, or Shadowrocket's Settings → Other → \"Include route 10.7.0.1/32\". Then connect to Wi-Fi." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在代理 App 中开启本地连接，可以是 Surge 或 Loon 的 Poki 模块、sing-box 的 loopback_address，或 Shadowrocket 的“设置 › 其他 › 包含路由 10.7.0.1/32”。然后连接无线局域网。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在代理 App 中開啟本機連線，可以是 Surge 或 Loon 的 Poki 模組、sing-box 的 loopback_address，或 Shadowrocket 的「設定 › 其他 › 包含路由 10.7.0.1/32」。然後連線無線區域網。"
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bật loopback trong ứng dụng proxy: mô-đun Poki trong Surge hoặc Loon, loopback_address trong sing-box, hoặc Cài đặt → Khác → \"Include route 10.7.0.1/32\" trong Shadowrocket. Sau đó kết nối Wi-Fi."
