            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tạo khóa tại openrouter.ai/keys rồi dán vào đây."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Subscribe to OpenCode Go at opencode.ai, then copy its API key from the OpenCode Console. Models and available regions depend on your Go plan and privacy settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 opencode.ai 订阅 OpenCode Go，然后从 OpenCode Console 拷贝 API 密钥。可用的模型和地区取决于你的 Go 套餐和隐私设置。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 opencode.ai 訂閱 OpenCode Go，然後從 OpenCode Console 複製 API 金鑰。可用的模型和地區取決於你的 Go 套餐和隱私設定。"
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
