    "The update is almost in. Poki will close to finish it. Open Poki again afterwards." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "更新即将完成。Poki 将关闭以完成更新。之后请重新打开 Poki。"
