    },
    "Payments, deletions in menus and confirmation dialogs (and matching deletions when full screen details are unavailable, such as voice taps by button name), and Wallet actions always require your confirmation; other sensitive steps go ahead without asking." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "付款、菜单和确认弹窗中的删除（以及缺少完整页面信息时，例如仅凭按钮名称发起语音操作时符合条件的删除）和“钱包”操作始终需要你确认，其他敏感步骤直接进行。"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
